      {
        "text": "Together with Mountain Pledge Gu, it works like Poison Vow Gu, but Poison Vow Gu is an expenditure Gu while these two can be used repeatedly. Fang Yuan names an obvious weakness: the oath must face the sea, and destroying that piece of ocean ends the oath’s effect.",
