  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "On San Cha Mountain, when Fang Yuan corners Chou Jiu over the Door of Life and Death, Chou Jiu refuses to speak because he has vowed before the sea oath Gu not to reveal the details to outsiders, or he will turn to dust.",
        "chapters": [
          384
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_san_cha_mountain",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "char_chou_jiu",
          "loc_door_of_life_and_death"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Chou Jiu’s sea is inside Shadow Sect’s blessed land, which closes a loop: naming that blessed land’s location would already break the vow he cannot speak past. Fang Yuan tests him and concludes the sea oath is real, because Chou Jiu still will not name the place even when frantic.",
        "chapters": [
          384
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "chou-jius-oath",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_shadow_sect"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Bai Ning Bing agrees to Chou Jiu’s request and temporarily joins Shadow Sect, making an oath in front of the Immortal Gu Sea Oath Gu with Old Man Yan Shi and Chou Jiu: she is free to leave once they kill Fang Yuan, and Shadow Sect cannot move against her directly or indirectly.",
        "chapters": [
          468
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "bai-ning-bings-shadow-sect-oath",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_bai_ning_bing",
          "char_old_man_yan_shi"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Later text lists sea oath Gu among the most common oath and vow forms of information path cultivation, together with mountain pledge Gu, promise Gu, and black and white paper Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          2023
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "information-path",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_immortal_gu_promise"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
